WEBVTT

00:39:30.038 --> 00:39:31.913
You liked it that you're willing
to talk about it.

00:39:31.913 --> 00:39:34.413
It's a huge gift to me and our listeners.

00:39:34.413 --> 00:39:38.454
And I loved getting a little bit inside
of your mind and your work life.

00:39:38.454 --> 00:39:43.954
And most importantly, the work you
do has has always been just

00:39:43.954 --> 00:39:45.371
a huge source of inspiration to me.

00:39:45.371 --> 00:39:49.163
But over the past year, you have
been a source of light and hope

00:39:49.163 --> 00:39:51.871
and entertainment and creative inspiration
.

00:39:51.871 --> 00:39:53.746
And I just want to thank you for

00:39:53.746 --> 00:39:57.496
for everything that you do to entertain
us and to get us to rethink so many of

00:39:57.496 --> 00:39:58.746
the things that we think we know.

00:39:59.371 --> 00:40:00.871
Holy crap. That was unbelievable.